OL,3,GNEWSAFlyover demolition completed after
OL,4,Asix months
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe last section of a condemned
OL,7,Fflyover, which was abruptly shut almost
OL,8,Ftwo years ago over fears it could
OL,9,Fcollapse, has been torn down.
OL,11,FIt has taken six months to demolish
OL,12,FGateshead's A167 flyover after the
OL,13,F1960s structure was closed in December
OL,14,F2024.
OL,16,FUnder the previous Labour
OL,17,Fadministration, Gateshead Council had
OL,18,Fset aside #18m for the demolition
OL,19,Fworks. However, the Local Democracy
OL,20,FReporting Service previously reported
OL,21,Fthe costs had climbed to #31m.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,396,390,260,160,0,100
