OL,3,GNEWSAFlyover demolition completed after
OL,4,Asix months
OL,5,
OL,6,FDemolition manager Jim Smith said the
OL,7,Fproject had "its challenges",
OL,8,Fespecially as part of the road was
OL,9,Fdirectly above Tyne and Wear Metro
OL,10,Ftunnels.
